          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "All aboard this very special Yoto Daily draw-along collection in partnership with Trainline. \n\nGet your paper, pens and pencils ready and join Jake from Yoto Daily for 12 fabulous draw-along activities to make your train journey - wherever you may be travelling to - just that little bit more exciting. \n\nSimply link to a Make Your Own card and download to your Yoto Player or Yoto Mini before you set off to play offline.  \n\nFull card.  \nAvailable until 1st September.  \nFor ages 3-10.",
